{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>筲箕灣有電車出軌，鏟上行人路撞毀食肆，無人受傷。</p><p></p><p>網上圖片可見，電車部分車身停在行人路，電車車頭撞毀一間食肆鐵閘及招牌。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.TRAM-0130_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026CBTJaNwV6L1791754154.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>事發在凌晨近一時，現場消息指涉事電車沒有載客，正駛回西灣河車廠，在東大街一個彎位剷上行人路，電車司機沒有受傷，事故原因有待警方調查。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.TRAM-0130_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026XAeMYQrxzE1791754156.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-11T22:17:59.730241+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}